Subject: [PATCH 08/41] dt-bindings: usb: apple,dwc3: Add t8132 compatible

The DWC3 USB controllers on t8132 (M4) are compatible with those on
t8103.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,dwc3.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,dwc3.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,dwc3.yaml
index f70c33f32..f49e1a037 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,dwc3.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,dwc3.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
               - apple,t6000-dwc3
               - apple,t6020-dwc3
               - apple,t8112-dwc3
+              - apple,t8132-dwc3
           - const: apple,t8103-dwc3
       - const: apple,t8103-dwc3
 
